    "detailed_description": "This is a walking simulator, relax and enter the world of the Toy Maker.<br>Explore lost areas and hidden passages to discover the secrets of the unknown Japanese lost game: Toy Maker.<br>Every game session is very dynamic so unlocking levels and secrets might take lot of tries depending on luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Use headphones for better immersion<br>    </li><li>Use arrow keys to walk, no WASD for a more retro feel<br>    </li><li>ALT+F4 to close<br>    </li><li>Ported to Windows 7+<br>    </li><li>Explore creepy surroundings<br>    </li><li>Discover secrets out of bounds<br>    </li><li>Jumpscares<br>    </li><li>Walking simulator<br>    </li><li>More levels will be added in future updates</li></ul>",
